# Pass 6, group a (2026-10-21): developer, VPN and OTA-patch tools that nothing starts: IPsec/L2TP VPN (racoon, mtpd, pppd; their init files are on demand,
# `disabled`), bug reports (dumpstate, bugreport*), the Android framework helpers of an image without framework (monkey, bmgr, ime, appops), applypatch and bspatch
# (OTA patching), schedtest, SoftHSM's command line tool, Amazon's Bluetooth command line clients.  Named by no running file (checked in docs/cloud-free.md).
